---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="PPD Technology | Healthcare Payment Solutions">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css"
    />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="healthcare-page">
    <section class="hero-healthcare">
      <div class="healthcare-background healthcare-circle-1"></div>
      <div class="healthcare-background healthcare-circle-2"></div>

      <div class="container healthcare-hero-content">
        <div class="healthcare-hero-text">
          <h1>Streamlined Healthcare Payment Solutions</h1>
          <p>
            Simplify patient payments, reduce administrative burden, and improve
            financial outcomes with our HIPAA-compliant payment platform designed
            specifically for healthcare providers.
          </p>

          <div class="healthcare-hero-buttons">
            <a class="page-btn btn-healthcare" href="#demo-form">Schedule a Demo</a>
            <a class="page-btn hero-outline" href="#solutions">Learn More</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="healthcare-animation" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="healthcare-terminal">
            <div class="healthcare-screen">Payment: Approved</div>
            <div class="healthcare-icons">
              <div class="healthcare-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-md"></i></div>
              <div class="healthcare-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i></div>
              <div class="healthcare-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="healthcare-card card-1">INS</div>
          <div class="healthcare-card card-2">HSA</div>
          <div class="healthcare-card card-3">CO-PAY</div>

          <div class="healthcare-data data-1"></div>
          <div class="healthcare-data data-2"></div>
          <div class="healthcare-data data-3"></div>

          <div class="healthcare-security security-1"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></div>
          <div class="healthcare-check check-1"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
          <div class="healthcare-badge badge-1">HIPAA</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="healthcare-challenges">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Addressing Healthcare Payment Challenges</h2>
          <p>Healthcare providers face unique payment challenges that require specialized solutions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="challenges-grid">
          <div class="challenge-card">
            <div class="challenge-icon"><i class="fas fa-clock"></i></div>
            <h3>Time-Consuming Billing</h3>
            <p>Manual billing processes consume valuable staff time that could be spent on patient care.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="challenge-card">
            <div class="challenge-icon"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i></div>
            <h3>Regulatory Compliance</h3>
            <p>Navigating HIPAA and other healthcare regulations adds complexity to payment processing.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="challenge-card">
            <div class="challenge-icon"><i class="fas fa-money-bill-wave"></i></div>
            <h3>Patient Payment Collection</h3>
            <p>Collecting patient payments at the point of service remains a significant challenge.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="challenge-card">
            <div class="challenge-icon"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i></div>
            <h3>Insurance Claim Delays</h3>
            <p>Delays in insurance payments create cash flow challenges for healthcare providers.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="challenge-card">
            <div class="challenge-icon"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i></div>
            <h3>Digital Payment Expectations</h3>
            <p>Patients increasingly expect digital payment options similar to other industries.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="challenge-card">
            <div class="challenge-icon"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i></div>
            <h3>Revenue Cycle Management</h3>
            <p>Inefficient payment processes negatively impact the entire revenue cycle.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="healthcare-solutions" id="solutions">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Tailored Healthcare Payment Solutions</h2>
          <p>Our platform is designed specifically to meet the unique needs of healthcare providers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="solutions-grid-healthcare">
          <div class="solution-card-healthcare">
            <div class="solution-image-healthcare"><i class="fas fa-user-injured"></i></div>
            <div class="solution-content-healthcare">
              <h3>Patient Payment Portal</h3>
              <p>Secure online portal for patients to view statements, make payments, and set up payment plans.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="solution-card-healthcare">
            <div class="solution-image-healthcare"><i class="fas fa-file-medical-alt"></i></div>
            <div class="solution-content-healthcare">
              <h3>Insurance Payment Automation</h3>
              <p>Streamline claim submission, tracking, and payment reconciliation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="solution-card-healthcare">
            <div class="solution-image-healthcare"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i></div>
            <div class="solution-content-healthcare">
              <h3>Point-of-Service Payments</h3>
              <p>Accept payments at check-in, check-out, or bedside with mobile-friendly solutions.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="solution-card-healthcare">
            <div class="solution-image-healthcare"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
            <div class="solution-content-healthcare">
              <h3>HIPAA-Compliant Security</h3>
              <p>End-to-end encryption and secure data handling that protect PHI.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="solution-card-healthcare">
            <div class="solution-image-healthcare"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i></div>
            <div class="solution-content-healthcare">
              <h3>Revenue Analytics</h3>
              <p>Comprehensive reporting to track payment performance and identify opportunities.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="solution-card-healthcare">
            <div class="solution-image-healthcare"><i class="fas fa-plug"></i></div>
            <div class="solution-content-healthcare">
              <h3>EHR/EMR Integration</h3>
              <p>Seamless integration with popular EHR and practice management systems.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="healthcare-workflow">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Streamlined Payment Workflow</h2>
          <p>Our platform simplifies the entire healthcare payment process from start to finish.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-steps">
          <div class="workflow-step">
            <div class="step-number">1</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Patient Check-In</h3>
              <p>Collect insurance information and estimate patient responsibility before the appointment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-arrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></div>

          <div class="workflow-step">
            <div class="step-number">2</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Service Delivery</h3>
              <p>Provide care while eligibility and benefits are checked automatically.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-arrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></div>

          <div class="workflow-step">
            <div class="step-number">3</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Payment Collection</h3>
              <p>Collect patient payments at point of service with flexible options.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-arrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></div>

          <div class="workflow-step">
            <div class="step-number">4</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>Claims Processing</h3>
              <p>Automated claim submission with real-time tracking and status updates.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="healthcare-compliance">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Built for Healthcare Compliance</h2>
          <p>Our platform meets the strictest healthcare security and privacy standards.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="compliance-content">
          <div class="compliance-badge"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
          <p class="compliance-copy">
            We understand that healthcare payment processing requires adherence to stringent regulations.
            Our platform is designed with healthcare compliance at its core.
          </p>

          <div class="compliance-features">
            <div class="compliance-feature">
              <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
              <div>
                <h4>HIPAA Compliant</h4>
                <p>Full compliance with Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act requirements</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="compliance-feature">
              <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
              <div>
                <h4>PCI DSS Certified</h4>
                <p>Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard Level 1 certification</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="compliance-feature">
              <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
              <div>
                <h4>Data Encryption</h4>
                <p>End-to-end encryption for all patient data and payment information</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="compliance-feature">
              <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
              <div>
                <h4>Audit Trails</h4>
                <p>Comprehensive logging and reporting for compliance audits</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-healthcare" id="cta-healthcare">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready to Transform Your Healthcare Payments?</h2>
        <p>
          Join hundreds of healthcare providers who trust PPD Technology with their payment processing needs.
        </p>
        <a class="page-btn cta-white-btn" href="#demo-form">Schedule a Demo</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="demo-section" id="demo-form">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Schedule a Healthcare Demo</h2>
          <p>
            Tell us about your practice and we’ll reach out with a tailored walkthrough.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="demo-grid">
          <div class="demo-card">
            <h4><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i> Tell us about your practice</h4>

            <form
              id="demoForm"
              class="demo-form"
              action="https://formspree.io/f/xpwyrann"
              method="POST"
            >
              <div class="row">
                <div>
                  <label for="name">Full Name</label>
                  <input id="name" required name="name" placeholder="Jane Doe" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="business">Organization</label>
                  <input id="business" required name="business" placeholder="City Health Group" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="row">
                <div>
                  <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                  <input id="phone" required name="phone" inputmode="tel" placeholder="(555) 555-5555" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="email">Email</label>
                  <input id="email" required name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="row">
                <div>
                  <label for="city">Location</label>
                  <input id="city" name="city" placeholder="City, State" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="time">Best Contact Time</label>
                  <select id="time" name="time">
                    <option value="">Select…</option>
                    <option>Morning</option>
                    <option>Afternoon</option>
                    <option>Evening</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <label>What do you want to see?</label>
              <div class="row topics-row">
                <label class="checkbox-label">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="topics" value="Patient Portal" /> Patient Payment Portal
                </label>
                <label class="checkbox-label">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="topics" value="Insurance Automation" /> Insurance Automation
                </label>
              </div>

              <div class="row topics-row">
                <label class="checkbox-label">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="topics" value="POS" /> Point-of-Service Payments
                </label>
                <label class="checkbox-label">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="topics" value="EHR" /> EHR/EMR Integration
                </label>
              </div>

              <label for="notes">Notes</label>
              <textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Current challenges, integrations, timeline…"></textarea>

              <button type="submit" class="page-btn btn-healthcare submit-btn">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Request Demo
              </button>

              <p class="muted-note">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i> We never share your info. By submitting, you agree to be contacted about PPD products.
              </p>
            </form>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-card">
            <h4><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i> What we’ll cover</h4>
            <ul class="demo-list">
              <li>Patient portal walkthrough & payment plans</li>
              <li>Insurance claim automation & reconciliation</li>
              <li>Point-of-service payments and mobile workflows</li>
              <li>EHR/EMR integration options</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="preview-spacer"></div>

            <h4><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-play"></i> Quick preview</h4>
            <div class="video-wrap">
              <iframe
                title="PPD Healthcare Preview"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_ILr_fQTI_w?autoplay=0&rel=0&modestbranding=1"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <style>
    .healthcare-page {
      --primary: #1549FF;
      --primary-dark: #0F38CC;
      --secondary: #060E21;
      --accent: #00E5A0;
      --healthcare-teal: #06B6D4;
      --healthcare-light: #EFF8FF;
      --light: #F5F8FF;
      --dark: #060E21;
      --gray: #7B93B0;
      --light-gray: #E2E8F4;
      --line: #E2E8F4;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      color: var(--dark);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background-color: var(--light);
    }

    .healthcare-page .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .healthcare-page .page-btn {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
    }

    .healthcare-page .btn-healthcare {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D60FF, var(--primary));
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(21,73,255,.35);
    }

    .healthcare-page .btn-healthcare:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(21,73,255,.45);
    }

    .healthcare-page .hero-outline {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
    }

    .healthcare-page .hero-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
    }

    .healthcare-page .cta-white-btn {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--healthcare-teal);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .healthcare-page .hero-healthcare {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 70% at 80% -10%, rgba(6,182,212,.3) 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at -10% 100%, rgba(21,73,255,.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
        linear-gradient(160deg, #060E21 0%, #0C1A38 60%, #0a1c42 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 80px 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .healthcare-page .hero-healthcare::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
      background:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.025'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events:none;opacity:.3;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-hero-content {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-hero-text {
      flex: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-hero-text h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-hero-text p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      color: #eafcfc;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-animation {
      flex: 1;
      position: relative;
      height: 300px;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-terminal {
      position: relative;
      width: 260px;
      height: 180px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #060E21, var(--healthcare-teal));
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      z-index: 3;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-screen {
      width: 85%;
      height: 60px;
      background: #060E21;
      margin: 25px auto 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-screen::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -100%;
      width: 50%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), transparent);
      animation: screenShine 4s infinite;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-icons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-card,
    .healthcare-page .healthcare-data,
    .healthcare-page .healthcare-security,
    .healthcare-page .healthcare-check,
    .healthcare-page .healthcare-badge {
      position: absolute;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-card {
      width: 70px;
      height: 45px;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #060E21, var(--healthcare-teal));
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      animation: cardSlideMobile 12s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    .healthcare-page .card-1 { top: 20%; left: 5%; }
    .healthcare-page .card-2 { top: 50%; left: 5%; animation-delay: 2s; }
    .healthcare-page .card-3 { top: 35%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 4s; }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-data {
      width: 50px;
      height: 5px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 3px;
      z-index: 1;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent);
      animation: dataFlowMobile 4s infinite linear;
    }

    .healthcare-page .data-1 { top: 15%; left: 30%; }
    .healthcare-page .data-2 { top: 40%; left: 20%; animation-delay: 1s; }
    .healthcare-page .data-3 { top: 65%; left: 25%; animation-delay: 2s; }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-security {
      width: 35px;
      height: 35px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--healthcare-teal);
      font-size: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 163, 163, 0.5);
      animation: badgePulse 5s infinite ease-in-out;
      z-index: 4;
    }

    .healthcare-page .security-1 { top: 15%; right: 15%; }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-check {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent);
      animation: checkPulse 4s infinite;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .healthcare-page .check-1 { top: 60%; right: 20%; }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-badge {
      width: 45px;
      height: 45px;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--healthcare-teal), #008b8b);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      animation: currencyFloat 8s infinite ease-in-out;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .healthcare-page .badge-1 { bottom: 15%; left: 15%; }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-background {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      opacity: 0.1;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-circle-1 {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      background: var(--accent);
      top: -100px;
      right: -100px;
      animation: pulseElement 15s infinite;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-circle-2 {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      background: var(--healthcare-teal);
      bottom: -75px;
      left: 10%;
      animation: pulseElement 12s infinite 2s;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-challenges,
    .healthcare-page .healthcare-workflow,
    .healthcare-page .healthcare-compliance,
    .healthcare-page .demo-section {
      padding: 70px 0;
      position: relative;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-challenges {
      background: var(--light);
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-solutions {
      padding: 70px 0;
      background: #fff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .healthcare-page .healthcare-solutions::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      background: rgba(0, 85, 255, 0.05);
